# Keep the Docker build context tiny. The multi-stage Dockerfiles copy ONLY the
# manifests + real sources (never target/), but without this file `docker build`
# would still UPLOAD the whole context to the daemon — including a multi-GB
# `target/` — on every build. Excluding it keeps `kind load`/buildx sends instant.
target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Editor/OS cruft.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~

# Local cargo registry caches that may live under the workspace in dev.
**/.cargo/registry/
**/.cargo/git/
